  "Wall-time cost of the strict contract: with the wall safety at 2x the budget, strict runs took 6.7-12.2 s for a 6 s budget here (experiment_1); strict-parallel overshoots its deterministic stop, so its wall time is typically closer to the 2x cap. Callers who need a hard wall bound should use determinism='fast'."
